# 15–20 Minute Overview

## Purpose

This is the preferred first meeting for companies unfamiliar with Frost & Sullivan or Best Practices Recognition.

## Meeting Framing

"I know I just threw quite a bit of information at you pretty quickly."

"Rather than try to cover everything on an unexpected call, would you be open to finding 15 to 20 minutes so I can give you a full overview of Frost & Sullivan, explain the Best Practices Recognition program and process, and answer any questions?"

## Preparation

"There isn't anything you need to prepare for the initial conversation."

## Suggested Agenda

- Frost & Sullivan
- Research context
- Best Practices Recognition
- Nomination and evaluation process
- Questions
- Next steps
